{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hancui-e-d4cb46364bae1f018730","title":"高柔谏免宋金家属重刑曹操采纳","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-d4cb46364bae1f018730","label":"正文","text":"高柔谏免宋金家属重刑曹操采纳","evidence":["hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","hancui-q-cb8457dca24091450075"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hancui-p-186c39aa42eed6","role":"逃亡","evidence":["hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","hancui-q-cb8457dca24091450075"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0017","role":"谏止重刑","evidence":["hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","hancui-q-cb8457dca24091450075"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"拟加刑；纳谏停杀","evidence":["hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","hancui-q-cb8457dca24091450075"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","hancui-q-cb8457dca24091450075"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","order":4950}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"hancui-p-186c39aa42eed6","name":"宋金","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0017","name":"高柔","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-9b2de1480e4b4410871e","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-2e27787f5f06a8179d55","layer":"original","quote":"鼓吹宋金等在合肥亡逃〖5〗。旧法：军征士亡，考竟其妻子〖6〗。太祖患犹不息〖7〗，更重其刑〖8〗。金有母、妻及二弟皆给官〖9〗，主者奏尽杀之。柔启曰：“士卒亡军，诚在可疾〖10〗，然窃闻其中时有悔者。愚谓乃宜贷其妻子〖11〗，一可使贼中不信〖12〗，二可使诱其还心。正如前科〖13〗，固已绝其意望；而猥复重之，柔恐自今在军之士，见一人亡逃，诛将及己，亦且相随而走，不可复得杀也。此重刑非所以止亡，乃所以益走耳〖14〗。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":210},{"id":"hancui-q-cb8457dca24091450075","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-06b8d4edc11960f0f74f","layer":"original","quote":"太祖曰：“善。”即止不杀金母、弟，蒙活者甚众〖15〗。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
